<title>USA: Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices fell this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.77 percent, down 10 basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.68 percent, also 10 basis points lower.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 6.01 percent, down 12.</p>
<p>					Latest Previous Last Date</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.77%    5.87%   5/2/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.68%    5.78%   5/2/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 6.01%    6.13%   5/2/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
